LaTeX source: {\dot{\mathbf{p}}}_{DR} = \begin{bmatrix}
{\dot{L}}_{DR} \\
{\dot{\lambda}}_{DR} \\
{\dot{h}}_{DR}
\end{bmatrix} = \begin{bmatrix}
0 & 1/R_{MhDR} & 0 \\
\sec L_{DR}/R_{NhDR} & 0 & 0 \\
0 & 0 & 1
\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}
v_{EOD}^{n} \\
v_{NOD}^{n} \\
v_{UOD}^{n}
\end{bmatrix} = \mathbf{M}_{Dpv}\mathbf{v}_{OD}^{n}\qquad(10.6-2)
